y again (error rate 0.002, down from 0.18).\n\n- **Rollback:** The first rollback attempt halted with an orchestrator error after us-east had already moved to v2.3.0. I checked the state and retried the same rollback, which completed in us-east, us-west and eu-west. v2.3.0 was the most recent healthy release, so no change-manager approval was needed.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 is open as SEV2 for checkout-api. The first incident request timed out, so I checked the incident list before anything else. It confirmed INC-0001 was created with the full summary, so I did not open a duplicate.\n\nFollow-ups for the on-call engineer:\n- Find out why v2.3.1 fails health checks. Its release candidate, v2.3.1-rc, is also unhealthy.\n- Find out why the orchestrator halted the first rollback attempt.\n- Keep v2.3.1 from being redeployed until it is fixed.", "type": "text"}]}]}